.TH PROWSETK 1 "2026-09-17" "ProwseTk 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
prowsetk \- headless browser automation and endpoint discovery
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prowsetk version
.br
.B prowsetk serve
[\fB--host\fR \fIADDRESS\fR] [\fB--port\fR \fIPORT\fR]
[\fB--web-root\fR \fIDIR\fR] [\fB--no-javascript\fR]
.br
.B prowsetk endpoints --url
\fIURL\fR [\fB--output\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB--no-javascript\fR]
.br
.B prowsetk run
\fIDRIVER\fR [\fB--config\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB--user-agent\fR \fIVALUE\fR]
[\fB--cookies-json\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB--\fIargument\fR \fIVALUE\fR ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
ProwseTk runs a headless automation engine without a graphical browser.
The \fBversion\fR command prints the installed version.
\fBserve\fR runs the embedded HTTP interface, listening on 127.0.0.1:8080
by default. \fBendpoints\fR discovers candidate endpoints and emits an
OpenAPI document; inferred endpoints carry provenance and confidence rather
than being authoritative. \fBrun\fR executes a declared Lua driver.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --host \fIADDRESS\fR
Address on which the embedded web interface listens.
.TP
.B --port \fIPORT\fR
Port on which the embedded web interface listens.
.TP
.B --web-root \fIDIR\fR
Directory containing the static web interface assets.
.TP
.B --url \fIURL\fR
Target URL for endpoint discovery or a declared driver argument.
.TP
.B --output \fIFILE\fR
Output file for endpoint discovery, or a declared driver argument.
.TP
.B --config \fIFILE\fR
Project configuration for \fBrun\fR (default: Prowse.toml).
.TP
.B --user-agent \fIVALUE\fR
Browser identity string for \fBrun\fR, overriding Prowse.toml.
.TP
.B --cookies-json \fIFILE\fR
Browser-exported JSON cookie file to import before plugins and drivers run.
.TP
.B --no-javascript
Disable page JavaScript for \fBserve\fR and \fBendpoints\fR.
.SH SECURITY
Drivers validate and coerce declared arguments. Secret arguments must not
be printed or logged. Network access remains mediated by the host engine.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I Prowse.toml
Project settings and driver declarations; see \fBProwse.toml\fR(5).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Prowse.toml (5)
